Findings
F01 - Incomplete Cost Breakdown Implementation
Priority: High

Initial audit identified missing cost breakdown records for Bookings 3-6.

Cleanup Sprint 1 completed repairs for:

Booking 4
Booking 5
Booking 6
Remaining:

Booking 3 cost breakdown reconstruction
Impact:

Reduced transparency
Harder invoice generation
Weaker reporting
Status:

Partially Resolved

F02 - Booking 3 Data Anomaly
Priority: High

Booking 3 does not follow the standard pricing model used by the other bookings.

Expected price:

5 nights × 860 SEK = 4300 SEK

Stored booking total:

4480 SEK

Difference:

180 SEK

Activities and workspace bookings do not explain the difference.

Recommendation:

Investigate and correct the booking before expanding the dataset.

Status:

Open

F03 - Duplicate Phone Storage
Priority: Medium

Phone numbers currently exist in both:

anvandare.telefon
profil.telefonnummer
Future versions should use one authoritative source.

Status:

Open

F04 - Availability Logic
Priority: Medium

Room availability currently depends on both:

room availability flag
booking dates
Long-term improvements may be required.

Status:

Open

F05 - WiFi Verification
Priority: Medium

The interviews consistently identified verified WiFi as one of the most important requirements.

The database currently stores WiFi speed but does not include any verification mechanism.

Possible future additions:

WiFi verification status
Verification date
Verification source
Historical speed tests
Status:

Future Enhancement

